Error: Jet.InvalidEnumDiscriminant: An enum discriminant is outside the signed integer range
  --> Tests/UI/computed_enum_range.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |     First = BASE + 1,
    |             ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The enum number is stored as a signed 64-bit integer in the type layout
 Fix: Use a number from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807
